m and its relevant implications for economics. In this framework, path dependence emerges as a unifying element which permeates the indissoluble and complex process and, starting from the construction of personal knowledge, reaches the social dimension of customs. This leads to meaningful perspectives for economic analysis, especially in reference to uncertainty, free will and efficacy. On a methodological level, the idea of a complete return of economics to social sciences is also supported."}]", "excerpt_truncated": true, "source_sha256": "3baa50ef0332cc2504e89c351899e6ea0247c976b1365e8227f4d9b1af629f8d", "verification_required": true, "topic_domain": "memory_formed_preferences", "evidence_role": "discovery", "host_tier": "discovery", "source_identity": null, "persistent_identifiers": ["doi:10.1007/978-3-031-34494-7_3", "openalex:W2405727102", "openalex:W1493329524", "openalex:W4385374953"], "source_candidates": ["https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-031-34494-7_3"], "source_candidate_identities": {}}
